## Known build-time fix (Phase A, recorded for provenance)
- The pip `ninja` package installed an empty (0-byte) binary on this platform
  (`pip check`: "ninja is not supported on this platform"). The editable build
  survived (torch BuildExtension fell back to make), but the server's runtime
  kernel-cache build execs `ninja` directly -> `OSError: [Errno 8] Exec format
  error`. Fix: `pip uninstall ninja`, then placed the known-good 370 KB ninja
  1.13.2 (identical to the working original venv's) into `.venv/bin/ninja`.
  `pip check` clean afterwards.

